39:41.433 --> 39:42.134
That's concerning.

39:42.534 --> 39:42.894
It is.

39:43.194 --> 39:43.775
And so...

39:44.475 --> 40:13.014
from my standpoint as director of agri-life research is how do we become even more efficient on less and less land to feed a growing population and then the other thing that we have a major problem with is water so there's competition now and more and more competition for water for people that is taking it away from

40:14.630 --> 40:17.311
the agricultural use water, right?

40:18.132 --> 40:32.639
