43:04.037 --> 43:06.179
So that's work that's going on right now.

43:06.699 --> 43:09.081
See, that makes me feel better.

43:09.622 --> 43:13.845
That's something I hope gets put out into the public and they hear about that.

43:14.450 --> 43:15.891
Yeah, that's right.

43:16.211 --> 43:38.169
Major concerns, right, with these data centers and storage facilities, right, energy storage facilities, is water is how they are cooled and how do we utilize water in such a way that it doesn't take away from the current needs.

43:39.230 --> 43:40.130
That makes sense.

