44:59.698 --> 45:24.422
that we don't have a solution for and so we spend a lot of time trying to figure out how do we prevent that stuff from being imported because once it gets into texas then it can spread through the rest of the years there's no other state that brings as many and as much agricultural products into the u.s than we do in texas

45:25.332 --> 45:35.800
