you know because basically a screw worm is a female only mates once but she'll plant the egg in an open wound of healthy flesh and then that screw basically the lava is just like a screw and it just drills itself into this live flesh so it's a lot of work yeah um and it usually is a wound so it could be where an animal has a bite or

