wildlife and hunting or oil and gas so those three forms in some way i shouldn't say oil and gas it could be renewable energy also so wind solar things like that so there's sort of three forms of income if you think that the screw room gets in here and has an impact on cattle and an impact on wildlife right that's going to be a significant drain on the landowners that could crash absolutely um

