well what happened is they stopped they closed down all of those facilities except for the one in panama and as the screw room was moving north the panama facility just couldn't produce enough sterile flies that makes sense so so they're building a new facility in texas right now to be able to just in case just yes to be able to help push those flies back so thank you for explaining that to me um yeah

